WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.120
Liverpool with intent in how they press here,

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.320
and Barcola could be in.

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.200
He's all on his own, his touch is good...

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.160
Just fluffs his lines.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.640
Isak has a little look up,
might find Mac Allister...

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.840
What a challenge that was
from Kayode - or was it?

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.160
Liverpool have a penalty.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.920
- I don't think that is a penalty, to be fair.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.480
The final decision is no penalty.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.280
Thiago. And the header coming in
is a brilliant one,

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.760
and it's Keane Lewis-Potter.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:38.800
Interesting battle, isn't it?
Before the ball has even been delivered.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:42.120
Jacquet has gone down holding his head.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.520
That's a headbutt, isn't it?

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.560
The final decision is a red card.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.760
Nice space found there,
Florian Wirtz for Victor Munoz,

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:57.960
the little chop back...

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.240
And a wonderful finish!

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:07.560
Liverpool's new firecracker gets the vital goal,
and they are bang back in it again at 1-1.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:13.880
- The home crowd just think every decision
is going against Brentford at the moment.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.600
- Mac Allister's ball in,
header down was from Barcola.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.800
Isak!
He doesn't miss them!

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.960
These strikers are at their most dangerous
when they're quiet

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:29.600
He always scores against Brentford,
Liverpool in front.

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:34.640
Corner from Mac Allister,
strong hand from Kelleher.

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:37.320
Only as far as Barcola! Wonderful effort.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:42.320
Rio Ngumoha takes on Janelt.

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:49.480
Janelt will get his second yellow card,
and he's off.

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:55.960
Barcola is the man to take over,
Koumas inside.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:00.480
Control from Koumas...
It was difficult, he was unbalanced.

